  "firstStaticFinding": "First prepared design shared one writable query table across specs. Peer found a custom earlier spec could change methods and return null, polluting later specs. Successor constructs fresh explicit eight-method view at each actual spec call; no source method reads at construction. No first product failure was executed or invented.",
